Word audio (the .mp3 files in this folder)

The word audio uses the voice "Amy" for Piper (https://github.com/rhasspy/piper, and its successor https://github.com/OHF-Voice/piper1-gpl), based on the Hi-Fi TTS dataset by NVIDIA
(Evelina Bakhturina, Vitaly Lavrukhin, Boris Ginsburg and Yang Zhang; https://www.openslr.org/109/), speaker Cori Samuel.
Dataset: CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
Voice: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://github.com/MycroftAI/mimic3-voices; https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).

The audio was generated by a program and then edited by the game's author (trimmed, volume levelled, speed adjusted, converted to MP3).
These audio files are shared under CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).

The audio is provided as it is, without warranty of any kind.
This does not mean that the creators of the dataset or the voice approve of this game.
